[TITLE]
API-05: reservoir R1 supplies J3 through two parallel pipes of different size

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID   Elev  Demand
 J1   0     0
 J2   0     0
 J3   0     300

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID   Head
 R1   100

[PIPES]
;ID  N1  N2  Length  Diam  Rough  Mloss  Status
 P1  R1  J1  1000    12    100    0      Open    ; link 1
 P2  J1  J2  1000    12    100    0      Open    ; link 2, carries most of the flow
 P3  J1  J2  1000    6     100    0      Open    ; link 3, carries the rest
 P4  J2  J3  1000    12    100    0      Open    ; link 4, carries all 300 gpm

[TIMES]
 Duration            2:00
 Hydraulic Timestep  1:00

[OPTIONS]
 Units      GPM
 Headloss   H-W
 Quality    None    ; EN_solveQ only transfers the hydraulics (see README)

[END]
